msgid "Configure the App Traffic Analyzer daemon. This tool identifies which applications and websites are being accessed on your network by analyzing DNS queries, TLS SNI headers, and HTTP requests."
msgstr "配置应用流量分析守护进程。此工具通过分析DNS查询、TLS SNI头和HTTP请求来识别网络中正在访问的应用程序和网站。"

msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "常规设置"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Enable or disable the traffic analyzer daemon."
msgstr "启用或禁用流量分析守护进程。"

msgid "Capture Interface"
msgstr "捕获接口"

msgid "Network interface to capture traffic on. Use 'any' to monitor all interfaces."
msgstr "要捕获流量的网络接口。使用 'any' 监控所有接口。"

msgid "Database Directory"
msgstr "数据库目录"

msgid "Directory to store the traffic database. One SQLite database file will be created here along with WAL journal files."
msgstr "存储流量数据库的目录。将在此创建SQLite数据库文件和WAL日志文件。"

msgid "Commit Interval"
msgstr "提交间隔"

msgid "How often traffic data is committed to disk. Shorter intervals reduce data loss risk but increase flash wear."
msgstr "流量数据提交到磁盘的频率。较短的间隔可降低数据丢失风险，但会增加闪存磨损。"

msgid "30s - Frequent commits (less data loss risk)"
msgstr "30秒 - 频繁提交（数据丢失风险低）"

msgid "60s - Normal (recommended)"
msgstr "60秒 - 正常（推荐）"

msgid "5m - Reduced flash wear"
msgstr "5分钟 - 减少闪存磨损"

msgid "10m - Minimal flash wear (more data loss risk)"
msgstr "10分钟 - 最小闪存磨损（数据丢失风险较高）"

msgid "1h - Least frequent (highest data loss risk)"
msgstr "1小时 - 最低频率（数据丢失风险最高）"

msgid "DNS Cache Timeout"
msgstr "DNS缓存超时"

msgid "How long (in seconds) IP-to-domain mappings are kept in memory. Longer timeouts improve detection accuracy but use more memory."
msgstr "IP到域名映射在内存中保留的时间（秒）。较长的超时可提高检测准确性，但会使用更多内存。"

msgid "Flow Timeout"
msgstr "流超时"

msgid "How long (in seconds) idle flows are tracked before removal. Longer timeouts capture long-lived connections but use more memory."
msgstr "空闲流量在移除前的跟踪时间（秒）。较长的超时可捕获长连接，但会使用更多内存。"

msgid "App Mapping Database"
msgstr "应用映射数据库"

msgid "Domain-to-application mapping rules. Each line maps a domain pattern to an application name. Use * as wildcard. Format: domain_pattern,app_name,category,priority"
msgstr "域名到应用程序的映射规则。每行将一个域名模式映射到一个应用名称。使用 * 作为通配符。格式：域名模式,应用名称,分类,优先级"
